{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02292","headline":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 八月 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 八月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孀妾怨长夜，独客梦归家。\n傍檐虫缉丝，向壁灯垂花。\n檐外月光吐，帘中树影斜。\n悠悠飞露姿，点缀池中荷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}